  "content": [
    {
      "text": "son of Jesse … is … prudent in matters, 1 Sam. 16:18. wise son, endued with prudence, 2 Chr. 2:12. wisdom dwell with prudence, Prov. 8:12. prudent man covereth shame, Prov. 12:16. prudent man concealeth knowledge, Prov. 12:23. Every prudent man dealeth with knowledge, Prov. 13:16. prudent man looketh well to his going, Prov. 14:15. prudent are crowned with knowledge, Prov. 14:18. wise in heart shall be called prudent, Prov. 16:21. heart of the prudent getteth knowledge, Prov. 18:15. prudent wife is from the Lord, Prov. 19:14. prudent man foreseeth the evil, Prov. 22:3. prudent in their own sight, Isa. 5:21 (2 Ne. 15:21). understanding of their prudent men shall be hid, Isa. 29:14 (2 Ne. 9:43; 27:26). my servant shall deal prudently, Isa. 52:13. is counsel perished from the prudent, Jer. 49:7. Who is … prudent, and he shall know them, Hosea 14:9. prudent shall keep silence in that time, Amos 5:13.",
